        "description": "The Smoke that Thunders, a kilometre-wide curtain of water, seen from clifftop paths.",
        "details": "Victoria Falls is one of the largest waterfalls in the world. The rainforest walk on the Zimbabwe side has fifteen viewpoints, including Danger Point, and gets very wet during the high flow from March to June. Raincoats are rented at the gate. In the dry season from September to December the flow is lower but views of the gorge are clear.",
